", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 9978, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Tau6xPEjJn9oKLV4m9yLa3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 11532, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and it is healthy again. The error rate dropped from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was unhealthy in production, so I chose v2.3.0, the most recent production release that had been healthy. The rollback finished verified.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged on-call. It describes the failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, and the next steps.\n\nThe v2.3.1 failure still needs investigating before anyone redeploys it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Dvz3qaPeWYEPyAL1uuuusa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MZ7x48L5YKeHjtLu8s3yJ5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in all three regions. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_018iSB5ZMRuw4C516SgsTbv2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014Fq3tB5LH9bjmYViAag7Gi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_na